                                "sense_id": "8b31c29f-82c0-3693-ae79-f0f7e2db5211",
                                "text": "Ideal for a balling hot time ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee37b87e-b353-4703-8e12-757d19c15937",
                                "sense_id": "8b31c29f-82c0-3693-ae79-f0f7e2db5211",
                                "text": "And as Doran said later, all bullshit aside, what balling broad could resist going to bed with a handsome dwarf ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fa07704-6006-4732-8a39-1e20466c3e23",
                                "sense_id": "8b31c29f-82c0-3693-ae79-f0f7e2db5211",
                                "text": "Having prayed \"for a tallish, not too much belly, brown-skinned, slow-smiling man with big hands and clean, neat fingernails […] who wouldn't argue about wearing a johnny,\" Kassima not only found her a \"nice man\" but she and Jones also had “a balling good time and started seeing each other regular” […]"
                            }
                        ]
